---
// Decorative bubbles, positioned as in the design file (1440px reference frame).
const bubbles = [
	{ size: 80, left: "80px", top: "40px" },
	{ size: 56, left: "660px", top: "80px" },
	{ size: 84, left: "1180px", top: "180px" },
];
---

<section id="solicitar-acceso" class="cta-band section">
	<div class="decor" aria-hidden="true">
		<span class="glow glow-1"></span>
		<span class="glow glow-2"></span>
		{
			bubbles.map((bubble) => (
				<span
					class="bubble"
					style={`width:${bubble.size}px;height:${bubble.size}px;left:${bubble.left};top:${bubble.top}`}
				/>
			))
		}
	</div>

	<div class="section-inner">
		<p class="badge">
			<span class="badge-dot"></span>
			LANZA TU PROPIA ACADEMIA HOY
		</p>

		<h2>Publica tu primer curso en minutos, no en semanas.</h2>

		<p class="subtext">
			Únete a las academias que ya están profesionalizando su enseñanza en toda
			Latinoamérica.
		</p>

		<div class="actions">
			<a class="cta-primary" href="mailto:hola@aprendofeliz.com">
				Solicitar acceso
			</a>
			<p class="email">
				¿Tienes preguntas? Escríbenos directamente a
				<a href="mailto:hola@aprendofeliz.com">hola@aprendofeliz.com</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta-band {
		position: relative;
		background: var(--logo-navy);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.decor {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.glow {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 50%;
		opacity: 0.2;
	}

	.glow-1 {
		width: 520px;
		height: 520px;
		left: -150px;
		top: -200px;
		background: var(--logo-magenta);
		filter: blur(110px);
	}

	.glow-2 {
		width: 580px;
		height: 580px;
		right: -190px;
		top: 150px;
		background: var(--logo-cyan);
		filter: blur(130px);
	}

	.bubble {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid #ffffff;
		opacity: 0.12;
	}

	.section-inner {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 32px;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		background: #ffffff18;
		border: 1px solid #ffffff30;
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 6px 14px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: var(--periwinkle);
	}

	.badge-dot {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--logo-cyan);
	}

	h2 {
		max-width: 700px;
		text-align: center;
		font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 42px);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.5px;
		line-height: 1.2;
		color: var(--white);
	}

	.subtext {
		max-width: 600px;
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 16px;
		color: #ffffffaa;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 16px;
	}

	.cta-primary {
		background: var(--gradient-brand);
		color: var(--white);
		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: 600;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 14px 32px;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease;
	}

	.cta-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.email {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #d7d7ffcc;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.email a {
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.bubble {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
